pdated shipment\n\n              Test 2: confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds and changes nothing\n              Verifies idempotency: repeated confirm calls on CONFIRMED shipment succeed without changes\n\n              Test 3: rejecting confirmation of a cancelled shipment with error envelope\n              Verifies HTTP 409 with SHIPMENT_CANCELLED error code when confirming CANCELLED shipment\n\n              Test 4: confirming a non-existent shipment with 404 error\n              Verifies HTTP 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND error code when confirming non-existent shipment\n\nVerification  cd sample-service && ./mvnw test\n              Result: 17 tests total, 0 failures\n              - 9 ShipmentControllerTest tests (5 existing + 4 new confirm tests)\n              - 4 OrderControllerTest tests (unchanged, passing)\n              - 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests test (unchanged, passing)\n              - 3 CustomerControllerTest tests (unchanged, passing)\n              BUILD SUCCESS\n\nNot done      None. All acceptance criteria met:\n              1. ✓ Existing build passes\n              2. ✓ Existing tests pass\n              3. ✓ POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm confirms created shipment and persists\n              4. ✓ Error responses consistent with rest of API\n              5. ✓ Repeated confirm succeeds; cancelled shipment refused; unknown id refused\n              6. ✓ No new Maven dependencies added\n              7. ✓ No unrelated production file changes\n```\n\n---\n\n**Implementation complete and verified.** All acceptance criteria satisfied. The confirm shipment endpoint is ready for review."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1977,"cache_read_input_tokens":37391,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1977},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_ma